invalid type: string "\u{cc6} ಮತ\u{ccd}ತು ಸಹಾಯವಾಣ\u{cbf}\nApplications are scrutinized by the Village Accountant and Revenue Inspector, verified by the Taluk Tahsildar / Assistant Director of\nAgriculture, and approved by the State Nodal Department before DBT disbursement. For issues or status check, contact Karnataka\nPM-KISAN Helpline: 155261 / 1800-115-526.", expected i64�